n<li>編曲｜Aaron Aranas、陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>合聲編寫｜Aaron Aranas</li>\n\n\n<li>合音演唱｜可蕾、杏仁ミル</li>\n\n\n<li>配唱製作人｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>人聲處理｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>電吉他、木吉他、電貝斯演奏｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>混音工程師｜陳柏豪</li>\n\n\n<li>母帶後期處理工程師｜Wayson Hsu</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"work-media\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-embed work-media-embed--youtube\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-youtube-75\"><h2 id=\"work-media-youtube-75\" class=\"work-media__heading\">YouTube</h2><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqgbkudH-zE\" title=\"純愛咪戀ミルミルニャー！｜〈純白和弦〉杏仁ミル聯動主題曲 — YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\t\n</div>\n\n",
